// Allocation-attribution fixture (attribution category, D-385/D-386): map
// construction only, no second loop. Splits Run_MapForIn's 1,000 "k${i}"
// interpolations from its second (values) snapshot array — phase 1 identified
// this split as unresolved (bench-allocation-attribution.md §6). No terminal
// print: every fixture in this category stops after its workload, so a pairwise
// subtraction covers only the intended difference.
m := map<string, int>{}
for i in 1..1000 {
    m.set("k${i}", i)
}
